);\nwriteFileSync('PROGRESS.md',\"'`# Progress'\"\\\\n\\\\nTitle: \"'${title}'\"\\\\nDevelopment folder: \\\\\"'`${folder}'\"\\\\\"'`'\"\\\\nDelivery: \\\\\"'`${folder}.html'\"\\\\\"'`'\"\\\\n\\\\n## Current work\\\\n- Read TASK.md and all of PLAN.md. Game-toolchain skill read.\\\\n- Real random draw from 50 private title candidates completed.\\\\n- Primary-source instructions and production history inspected.\\\\n- Next: vendor engine and Hub, establish shared interfaces, implement expedition.\\\\n\\\\n## Completion ledger\\\\n- [ ] Engine / protocol research and versions\\\\n- [ ] Authored campaign, core simulation, native presentation\\\\n- [ ] Inputs, audio, saves, menus, developer tools, attract\\\\n- [ ] Local, WebRTC, and Hub co-op\\\\n- [ ] Quiet tests and complete playthrough\\\\n- [ ] Bundle, interview, and final evidence\\\\n\\\\n## Working rules\\\\nKeep all development files in the named folder. Final HTML and exit-interview.json go beside this file. Preserve unrelated parent-repository work.\\\\n\"'`);\nwriteFileSync(folder+'\"'/identity.json',JSON.stringify({title,folder,html:folder+'.html'},null,2));\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({title,folder}));\nJS\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
