{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n '\"'^##|''^###'\"' vendor/engine/API.md\"","aggregated_output":"9:## Quick start (a complete game)\n40:## Look target (read this before drawing anything)\n53:## Coordinates: what x, y, z mean in each view\n70:## Rules\n79:## Common mistakes (check these first)\n90:## Game\n106:## Scenes (title, play, game over)\n117:## Motion and timing: tweens, scripts, paths, weather\n133:## Standard features (every game has them: don't build your own)\n140:## Input: `game.input`\n150:## Drawing: `r` in `draw(r)`\n159:## Pixels, sprites, text, UI\n168:## Sound: `game.audio` (chip synth, no files, starts after the first key press)\n174:## Levels\n186:## Movement and physics\n204:## Characters\n220:## Effects and lighting\n226:## Genre playbook (NES, SNES, Genesis, N64, PS1)\n266:## More: animation and examples outside this card\n290:## Before you hand the game back\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
