{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"agent_message","text":"The campaign now has 29 authored chambers, and a scripted ranger has completed the full route through normal movement, aiming, firing, and interaction commands. Native creature rendering and real two-browser WebRTC pairing also pass their focused checks. I’m connecting the screens, controls, saves, and audio, then I’ll test the packaged HTML.\n"}}
